Foundry pad data is NOT included
--------------------------------
Foundry pad-cell names, port maps and pin maps are not part of this product.
They are kept in separate pad packs, loaded by path (--pad-tech-dir,
NANOSOC_PAD_TECH_DIR; see soc_model/pad_packs.py). The bundled example pad
technology "generic" uses the SoC Labs generic library pad models.

